        "cooked": "<p>Oh.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I am also *sorely* tempted to, friday before I leave, put a bunch of [Redacted] boxes up on the Wiki, where I will be eventually putting links to the new things. *Sorely* tempted.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&gt;:D</p>",
