      {
        "id": 87472,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T05:54:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Personally, this topic got me thinking about it and now I've decided to stop creeping on the forum come february until I have vengeance. It isn't so much that I care about spoilers, but I was thinking about the Darkwatch promos and how cool that setback/expat thing was… except I didn't get it from seeing the cards but seeing people talking about it.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I doubt my \"woah\" moments would be co-opted by seeing them in threads, but I've decided not to risk it. I want to have my cool discoveries by handling the cards, then spend the next few hours catching back up to the forum discussions.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This is also partially because I know even if people did mark spoilers, the temptation to look would be so strong I'm not sure I'd be able to resist. I'm weak that way  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 73,
        "post_type": 1,
