        "created_at": "2014-01-24T07:24:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Considering how fast we seem to get packages here in Indy, would expect mine to be here only a day or so after they are shipped. In fact, back in December when they said they were waiting to ship stuff&nbsp;till the 17th, I think I got my stuff on the 17th and that was an EE box, the RC/IR box, and a&nbsp;Mr. Chomps.</p>",
