      {
        "id": 87475,
        "name": "broccoli",
        "username": "broccoli",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-24T18:01:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was a playtester, so I probably won't have as many questions as other folks, but I think I'm just going to go with the simple solution of putting \"Vengeance\" in the title of any Vengeance specific threads I create.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To me, it's a reasonable compromise. &nbsp;People can see the threads and decide individually if they want spoilers or not. &nbsp;It doesn't require a separate forum, and users can read or not read them as they get their copies.</p>",
